@host = http://localhost:8080

### Login do ADMIN → copie o token para a variável abaixo
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@fit.com", "password": "admin123"}

### Login da Ana (USER)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "ana@fit.com", "password": "ana123"}

@token = cole-o-token-aqui

### Cadastro → 201 (repetir dá 409)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Carlos Lima", "email": "carlos@fit.com", "password": "carlos123"}

### Listar: página 0 com 10 aulas, por horário
GET {{host}}/classes

### Página 2 com 5 aulas
GET {{host}}/classes?page=2&size=5

### Query by Example
GET {{host}}/classes/example?modality=YOGA&level=BEGINNER&instructor=carla mendes

### Specification: título contém, faixa de horário e só com vaga
GET {{host}}/classes/search?title=yoga&startsAfter=2026-11-01T00:00:00&startsBefore=2026-11-05T23:59:59&availableOnly=true

### Uma aula (os links mudam conforme o token)
GET {{host}}/classes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Aula inexistente → 404
GET {{host}}/classes/999

### Criar (ADMIN) → 201 + Location
POST {{host}}/classes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Funcional ao ar livre",
  "modality": "FUNCTIONAL",
  "level": "INTERMEDIATE",
  "instructor": "Rafael Souza",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-01T10:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "capacity": 15
}

### Criar sem token → 401
POST {{host}}/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Sem token"}

### Atualizar (ADMIN) → 200
PUT {{host}}/classes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Yoga reformulado",
  "modality": "YOGA",
  "level": "BEGINNER",
  "instructor": "Carla Mendes",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-02T07:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 60,
  "capacity": 30
}

### Excluir (ADMIN) → 204
DELETE {{host}}/classes/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inscrever-se → 201 (repetir ou aula lotada dá 409)
POST {{host}}/classes/3/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Minhas inscrições
GET {{host}}/enrollments/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancelar inscrição (dono ou ADMIN) → 204; de outro aluno → 403
DELETE {{host}}/enrollments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
